@startuml fig3-6
title 图 3-6  跨端协同同步时序图

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "用户" as U
participant "手机端" as Phone
participant "SyncHub" as Hub
database "MySQL" as DB
participant "车机端" as Car

== 设备上线 ==
Phone -> Hub : connect + subscribe
Hub -> DB : 写入在线设备表
Hub -> Car : broadcast device.online
Car -> Hub : connect + subscribe
Hub -> DB : 写入在线设备表
Hub -> Phone : broadcast device.online

== 续接发起 ==
U -> Phone : 点击续接到车机
Phone -> Hub : POST handover请求

== 持久化与广播 ==
Hub -> DB : 写入续接任务表
Hub -> Car : 转发handover事件

== 车机端确认 ==
Car -> Car : 显示待确认卡片
Car -> Car : 驾驶员确认续接

== 续接执行 ==
Car -> Car : 加载并播放媒体

== 状态回流 ==
Car -> Hub : POST 状态更新
Hub -> DB : 更新播放状态
Hub -> Phone : 转发状态变更
Phone -> Phone : 暂停播放

@enduml
